<div class="student-home">
  <img class="home-banner" src="/MetroFaith_Banner.svg" alt="Metro FAITH Scheme" onerror="this.hidden=true">
  <section aria-labelledby="about-heading">
    <h1 id="about-heading" class="home-heading"><img src="/Header_icon-1.svg" alt="">About Metro FAITH Scheme</h1>
    <p>The University has launched a new whole-person development framework – <a href="https://www.hkmu.edu.hk/sao/metro-faith/">Metro FAITH</a> to offer students a unique university journey since 2024/25 academic year. The Scheme helps nurture students with a positive mindset and build up their own faith to face difficulties in life. The Scheme takes as its organising principle the essential virtues in positive psychology of the West and the educational concepts of Confucianism of the East, but they are integrated and reengineered so that they match with modern social and technological realities, and help students build stronger inner strength. The faith here focuses on instilling five key categories in our students:</p>
    <img class="home-categories" src="/Categories.png" alt="The five Metro FAITH categories: Future skills and intelligence, Aesthetics and spirituality, Igniting and sports, Temperance and justice, and Humanity and love" onerror="this.hidden=true;this.nextElementSibling.hidden=false">
    <ul class="category-fallback" hidden><li>Future skills &amp; intelligence</li><li>Aesthetics &amp; spirituality</li><li>Igniting &amp; sports</li><li>Temperance &amp; justice</li><li>Humanity &amp; love</li></ul>
  </section>
  <section aria-labelledby="level-heading">
    <h2 id="level-heading" class="home-heading"><img src="/Header_icon-2.svg" alt="">Scheme Level</h2>
    <div class="home-table-wrap"><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Attained Level</th><th scope="col">Requirements</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Beginning Level</td><td>Less than 3 engagement hours in any one category</td></tr><tr><td>Accomplishing Level</td><td>At least 3 engagement hours each category</td></tr><tr><td>Mastering Level</td><td>At least 5 engagement hours each category</td></tr></tbody></table></div>
  </section>
  <section aria-labelledby="criteria-heading">
    <h2 id="criteria-heading" class="home-heading"><img src="/Header_icon-3.svg" alt="">Criteria for Student Development Activities under Metro FAITH Scheme</h2>
    <ul><li>The activity is organized or co-organized by a School/ Office of the University.</li><li>The activity is not an official credit-bearing course at the University and is not an academic requirement stipulated by the study programme.</li><li>The activity is categorized into one of the key categories under the Metro FAITH Framework.</li><li>The activity has its intended learning outcome to reflect the key category under the Metro FAITH Framework.</li></ul>
  </section>
</div>
